# A tab inside a project's name shows as a space in the paths that name it: a view entry's path, the breadcrumbs and the Quick Add title.
file <<END
Big	Work:
	- Ship @due({today+2})
END
keys gU j
see - Ship  Big Work
hide BigWork
keys gz
see › Big Work
hide BigWork
keys qq
type Plan
keys <Space> /
type big
keys <Enter>
see Quick Add → Big Work
hide BigWork
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
Big	Work:
	- Ship @due({today+2})
END
